siem-soar-investigation is the vendor-neutral SIEM/SOAR concepts umbrella. The SIEM and SOAR
strategy, detection engineering, normalisation, onboarding, platform-selection, and SOC-operations
material is sourced from chrishuffman5 (MIT) and is the primary bulk. The network-device log-forensics
reference is genericised from two vahagn (Apache-2.0) skills; concepts and methodology only, no
verbatim copy. Skill licensed MIT; the Apache-2.0 secondary is attributed here per the cloudflare-dns-ops
precedent (DNS PR4, MIT-primary + netclaw Apache genericised).

